@* A closing call on a site's page (F118, ADR 0106): a band with a strip in the site's strip colour, a heading, a line
   of words and the action. It is an area of the page like any band, so the index lists it and it has its address.
   Its class is prefixed, as a shared name must be: a bare .strip was already a film's layer on this site. *@
<Band Id="@Id" Short="@Short" Class="band-strip reveal">
    <div class="site-strip">
        <h2 class="reveal">@Heading</h2>
        @if (ChildContent is not null)
        {
            <p>@ChildContent</p>
        }
        @Action
    </div>
</Band>
